'''Spike''' is a [[Spells|spell]] of unknown type.

==Description==
Spike generates several large spikes directly from the seal that are flung out at lethal speeds, and is a spell used for offensive purposes.{{Ref|m|27|16}} The construction of the spell is entirely unknown.

==Usage==
The spell was seen used by [[Sasaran]] during his fight with [[Qifrey]] within the [[Serpentback Cave]]. When Sasaran fired the spell at Qifrey, Qifrey managed to block it with a wall of earth.{{Ref|m|27|17}}
